WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:02.736
-Our first guest tonight is an
Academy Award- and Emmy-winning

00:00:02.736 --> 00:00:04.371 align:start size:94% position:6%
actress you know from
"Love Actually"

00:00:04.371 --> 00:00:05.271 line:92%
and "Sense and Sensibility."

00:00:05.271 --> 00:00:07.273 align:start size:94% position:6%
She's currently starring in
"The Children Act,"

00:00:07.273 --> 00:00:09.809 size:81% position:41%
which is now available
exclusively on DirecTV

00:00:09.809 --> 00:00:11.211 line:92%
and in theaters this Friday.

00:00:11.211 --> 00:00:12.345 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Let's take a look.

00:00:12.345 --> 00:00:14.647 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Court, rise.

00:00:24.491 --> 00:00:26.659 align:start size:94% position:6%
-May it please you, My Lady?
-Yes, Mr. Simms.

00:00:26.659 --> 00:00:30.163
-My Lady, may I refer you
to my client's undertaking?

00:00:30.163 --> 00:00:32.632 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Your client, Mr. Simms,
is in direct breach

00:00:32.632 --> 00:00:33.733 align:start size:94% position:6%
of his undertaking
to this court.

00:00:33.733 --> 00:00:35.301
He's removed his daughter
from the jurisdiction.

00:00:35.301 --> 00:00:38.204
Now I hear he's in Rabat with
no intention of returning here.

00:00:38.204 --> 00:00:42.542 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was rather expecting to find
you blushing on his behalf.

00:00:44.210 --> 00:00:46.980
-Please welcome to the show
Emma Thompson, everyone.

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:49.949 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪♪♪

00:01:11.938 --> 00:01:16.943 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Welcome!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:16.943 --> 00:01:18.645 line:92%
-Thank you. Oh, I'm exhausted.

00:01:18.645 --> 00:01:20.780 align:start size:94% position:6%
-What a delight
to have you here.

00:01:20.780 --> 00:01:24.150 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Thank you very much.
And I'm thrilled to be here.

00:01:24.150 --> 00:01:26.019 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I want to congratulate
you, as well.

00:01:26.019 --> 00:01:29.389
You received an
order -- Am I saying this right?

00:01:29.389 --> 00:01:30.990 line:92%
An Order of the British Empire?

00:01:30.990 --> 00:01:35.528 size:81% position:41%
-Yes. Dame Commander
of the British Empire.

00:01:35.528 --> 00:01:36.596 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Dame Commander.

00:01:36.596 --> 00:01:38.198 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-That's something else.

00:01:38.198 --> 00:01:41.401 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:41.401 --> 00:01:46.272 align:start size:94% position:6%
I've become much more
commanding since it happened.

00:01:46.272 --> 00:01:46.706 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yes.

00:01:46.706 --> 00:01:48.174 align:start size:94% position:6%
-See that little bow
in that clip,

00:01:48.174 --> 00:01:51.010 size:84% position:42%
you know, where you see
everyone doing that?

00:01:51.010 --> 00:01:53.713 align:start size:94% position:6%
I've got everyone in
the family doing that now.

00:01:53.713 --> 00:01:54.180 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Oh, wow.

00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:58.518
-I've also had every seat
I sit on just slightly --

00:01:58.518 --> 00:01:59.752 size:78% position:39% line:92%
made slightly taller.

00:01:59.752 --> 00:02:02.222 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Just a small elevation.
-But it's subtle.

00:02:02.222 --> 00:02:03.156 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
-It's subtle.

00:02:03.156 --> 00:02:04.124 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, people are slightly,
you know,

00:02:04.124 --> 00:02:06.593 size:88% position:44%
just lifting their heads
slightly more towards me

00:02:06.593 --> 00:02:09.462
than they did before,
but they're not quite sure why.

00:02:09.462 --> 00:02:09.896 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yes.

00:02:09.896 --> 00:02:11.731 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, this isn't a situation
where they say,

00:02:11.731 --> 00:02:13.066 size:75% position:38% line:92%
"Oh, Emma's changed.

00:02:13.066 --> 00:02:13.867 line:92%
She's sitting in the big chair."

00:02:13.867 --> 00:02:15.135 align:start size:94% position:6%
You do it so subtly
that they just feel --

00:02:15.135 --> 00:02:16.035 align:start size:94% position:6%
-They'll never know.
-Right.

00:02:16.035 --> 00:02:18.438 align:start size:94% position:6%
-They'll never know.
-That's really something else.

00:02:18.438 --> 00:02:21.441
So, you would say that it has,
effectively, gone to your head?

00:02:21.441 --> 00:02:24.177 align:start size:94% position:6%
You're willing to accept that?
-Effectively.

00:02:24.177 --> 00:02:27.013 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah, I am.
I'm willing to accept that.

00:02:27.013 --> 00:02:30.183 align:start size:94% position:6%
-As far as your honors in your
life, is it right up there?

00:02:30.183 --> 00:02:32.051 align:start size:94% position:6%
Was it a moment where
you thought,

00:02:32.051 --> 00:02:32.986 line:92%
"This is really something"?

00:02:32.986 --> 00:02:35.021 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, actually,
it's quite interesting,

00:02:35.021 --> 00:02:39.726 align:start size:94% position:6%
because they send
you a letter saying,

00:02:39.726 --> 00:02:41.461 size:78% position:39% line:92%
"Will you accept it?"

00:02:41.461 --> 00:02:43.296 size:81% position:41% line:92%
You can choose not to.

00:02:43.296 --> 00:02:45.298 align:start size:94% position:6%
You can choose to say,
"Well, of course,

00:02:45.298 --> 00:02:46.933 align:start size:94% position:6%
we don't have
an empire anymore, thank God,

00:02:46.933 --> 00:02:49.802 align:start size:94% position:6%
because it was ghastly,
colonial, racist, dreadful,

00:02:49.802 --> 00:02:53.239 align:start size:94% position:6%
dreadful undertaking
on every level,"

00:02:53.239 --> 00:02:56.776 align:start size:94% position:6%
and actually have some moral
principle about it

00:02:56.776 --> 00:02:57.844 line:92%
or you can be like me and think,

00:02:57.844 --> 00:03:01.714 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Hmm, it's gonna be
a really nice badge."

00:03:01.714 --> 00:03:02.182 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:03:02.182 --> 00:03:06.319
Hard to say no to a badge.
-It's hard to say no to a badge.

00:03:06.319 --> 00:03:07.554 align:start size:94% position:6%
-A good badge.
-Come on.

00:03:07.554 --> 00:03:09.522 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So hard to find
a good badge these days.

00:03:09.522 --> 00:03:10.056 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Absolutely.

00:03:10.056 --> 00:03:13.693
And the Queen -- you know,
she'll have a little handbag,

00:03:13.693 --> 00:03:16.629
in which I happen to know
she keeps dog biscuits.

00:03:16.629 --> 00:03:20.066 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I know she's
a great lover of dogs, so...

00:03:20.066 --> 00:03:20.567 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-She does.

00:03:20.567 --> 00:03:22.101
She'll open her handbag,
take out a dog biscuit --

00:03:22.101 --> 00:03:26.206
I've seen this -- and do like
that, and the corgis roll over.

00:03:26.206 --> 00:03:26.806 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Really?
-Yeah.

00:03:26.806 --> 00:03:28.942 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I love that you can reach
an elevated place

00:03:28.942 --> 00:03:31.144 align:start size:94% position:6%
and still think there's
nothing better than watching

00:03:31.144 --> 00:03:32.812 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
a dog roll over.

00:03:32.812 --> 00:03:35.515
-Yeah, it makes you like her.
-That you never outgrow that.

00:03:35.515 --> 00:03:37.383 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, it really
makes you love her, I know.

00:03:37.383 --> 00:03:39.052
-I want to talk about this film.
But I'm very excited.

00:03:39.052 --> 00:03:43.389 align:start size:94% position:6%
You have a film coming up that
Mindy Kaling wrote

00:03:43.389 --> 00:03:44.691 align:start size:94% position:6%
called "Late Night,"
where you play

00:03:44.691 --> 00:03:46.159 line:92%
a late-night-talk-show host.

00:03:46.159 --> 00:03:46.593 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yes.

00:03:46.593 --> 00:03:50.296
-Did you enjoy being part
of this world, even fictionally?

00:03:50.296 --> 00:03:50.964 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-I did, I did.

00:03:50.964 --> 00:03:52.832 align:start size:94% position:6%
I thought,
"I could get into this."

00:03:52.832 --> 00:03:55.235 align:start size:94% position:6%
And my studio
was a little bit like this.

00:03:55.235 --> 00:03:58.571 align:start size:94% position:6%
My audience weren't nearly
as good as you guys,

00:03:58.571 --> 00:03:59.105 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
but, you know...

00:03:59.105 --> 00:04:01.808 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Right.

00:04:01.808 --> 00:04:02.408 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-But it was --

00:04:02.408 --> 00:04:05.044 align:start size:94% position:6%
-By the way,
you pander to them so well.

00:04:05.044 --> 00:04:06.312 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think you would be --
-I know.

00:04:06.312 --> 00:04:07.547 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I think you'd be
very good at job.

00:04:07.547 --> 00:04:10.783
-I'm good at
ingratiating myself with people.

00:04:10.783 --> 00:04:13.319 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, yeah, and I just --
I loved it.

00:04:13.319 --> 00:04:14.187 size:78% position:39% line:92%
I really did love it.

00:04:14.187 --> 00:04:14.988 line:92%
I got a kind of feel for it.

00:04:14.988 --> 00:04:17.857 align:start size:94% position:6%
And because I have such
admiration for you guys --

00:04:17.857 --> 00:04:19.425 line:92%
I mean, it's a very hard job.

00:04:19.425 --> 00:04:23.963 align:start size:94% position:6%
Night after night,
you have to, well, infuse,

00:04:23.963 --> 00:04:24.631 size:75% position:38% line:92%
and that's not easy.

00:04:24.631 --> 00:04:27.200
I mean, sometimes it's not --
-It's easier than you think.

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:29.335 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You know, you can't say --
Really?

00:04:29.335 --> 00:04:29.869 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah, it's --

00:04:29.869 --> 00:04:33.706 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You can't do, "So, this
very poor film that you're in

00:04:33.706 --> 00:04:35.375 line:92%
and which you're not very good,

00:04:35.375 --> 00:04:36.576 line:92%
how were attracted to the role?"

00:04:36.576 --> 00:04:38.077
I mean, you know,
you can't say things like that.

00:04:38.077 --> 00:04:40.680
-Well, those were all questions
I was about to ask you,

00:04:40.680 --> 00:04:41.948 size:84% position:42% line:92%
so now you've really...

00:04:41.948 --> 00:04:47.020
Now you've really put the rest
of this interview in jeopardy.

00:04:47.020 --> 00:04:47.453 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Damn it.

00:04:47.453 --> 00:04:50.890
-Did you speak to any talk-show
host before you did it?

00:04:50.890 --> 00:04:53.993 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, I didn't really,
actually.

00:04:53.993 --> 00:04:56.829 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Good. I'm glad, because
I know you didn't talk to me,

00:04:56.829 --> 00:04:58.464 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I would have been
very insulted.

00:04:58.464 --> 00:05:03.202
-I felt I didn't need to 'cause
I've done so many talk shows.

00:05:03.202 --> 00:05:04.037 line:92%
I tell you what I did do.

00:05:04.037 --> 00:05:06.706 align:start size:94% position:6%
I watched a lot of
old talk shows,

00:05:06.706 --> 00:05:09.342 align:start size:94% position:6%
'cause she would have --
'Cause she's my age.

00:05:09.342 --> 00:05:10.176 size:75% position:38% line:92%
She's like late 50s.

00:05:10.176 --> 00:05:11.711 align:start size:94% position:6%
So she would have grown up
with -- As I did.

00:05:11.711 --> 00:05:14.847
You know, the first talk show
I did was with Johnny Carson.

00:05:14.847 --> 00:05:16.182 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Did you really?
-Yes.

00:05:16.182 --> 00:05:16.683 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Wow!

00:05:16.683 --> 00:05:18.384 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I was dressed
like a geography teacher.

00:05:18.384 --> 00:05:20.019 line:92%
I had no idea about glamour.

00:05:20.019 --> 00:05:23.523 align:start size:94% position:6%
And Jimmy Carter
was on at the same time.

00:05:23.523 --> 00:05:25.825 align:start size:94% position:6%
He was so nice.
-That is a real --

00:05:25.825 --> 00:05:26.225 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-I know.

00:05:26.225 --> 00:05:28.094
-You really hit the jackpot
for your first talk show.

00:05:28.094 --> 00:05:30.830 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I know. It was such fun.
-Yeah.

00:05:30.830 --> 00:05:33.700 align:start size:94% position:6%
My first talk show was someone
canceled on Conan O'Brien,

00:05:33.700 --> 00:05:37.937 align:start size:94% position:6%
and they called me
like an hour beforehand.

00:05:37.937 --> 00:05:38.871 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
For real.

00:05:38.871 --> 00:05:41.741 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Were you appearing a guest?
-I was a guest, yeah.

00:05:41.741 --> 00:05:43.276 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah, they said,
"Somebody canceled.

00:05:43.276 --> 00:05:45.778 align:start size:94% position:6%
Will you come up
and play a pizza box?"

00:05:45.778 --> 00:05:47.747
No, they really did say,
"Will you come up and --"

00:05:47.747 --> 00:05:49.449 align:start size:94% position:6%
But that was because
we were in the building.

00:05:49.449 --> 00:05:49.982 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
He was here.

00:05:49.982 --> 00:05:51.651 align:start size:94% position:6%
And so if they ever had
last-minute cancellations,

00:05:51.651 --> 00:05:53.619 align:start size:94% position:6%
they would just basically
ring up, and the first person

00:05:53.619 --> 00:05:56.456 align:start size:94% position:6%
who answered,
they'd say, "Come down."

00:05:56.456 --> 00:05:58.157 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was a big deal
that first time.

00:05:58.157 --> 00:06:00.159 size:81% position:41%
It wasn't Jimmy Carter
or anything like that,

00:06:00.159 --> 00:06:02.729 line:92%
but this round goes to you.

